@DocuMind.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5288
# Paste the accessToken from the "Sign in" response below
@AccessToken = paste-access-token-here
@DocumentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@ChecklistId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@RunId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create a company account (you become its Admin); returns accessToken + refreshToken
POST {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "companyName": "Acme Ltd", "displayName": "Alice", "email": "alice@acme.example", "password": "a-long-passphrase" }

### Sign in
POST {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alice@acme.example", "password": "a-long-passphrase" }

### Who am I (company and role)
GET {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Invite a colleague (Admin only); returns a one-time token for the /invite/{token} link
POST {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/team/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "bob@acme.example", "role": "Member" }

### List team members
GET {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/team/members
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### List documents
GET {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Upload a PDF (put a sample.pdf next to this file)
POST {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=DocuMindBoundary

--DocuMindBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Sample contract
--DocuMindBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
--DocuMindBoundary--

### Get one document
GET {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/{{DocumentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Download the original file
GET {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/{{DocumentId}}/file
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Delete a document
DELETE {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/{{DocumentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Re-queue a document for processing (e.g. after adding a Voyage key)
POST {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/{{DocumentId}}/reprocess
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Ask a question (streams server-sent events)
POST {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "What are the payment terms?" }] }

### AI provider settings: which keys are saved (hints only) and which provider answers
GET {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/settings/ai
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Save and verify a key (provider: anthropic | openai | gemini | voyage)
PUT {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/settings/ai/keys/voyage
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "apiKey": "<your Voyage AI key>" }

### List the chat models a saved key can use
GET {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/settings/ai/keys/openai/models
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Choose a chat model
PUT {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/settings/ai/keys/openai/model
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "model": "<a model id from the list above>" }

### Choose which provider answers questions
PUT {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/settings/ai/chat-provider
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "provider": "anthropic" }

### Remove a saved key
DELETE {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/settings/ai/keys/openai
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Compliance audits: list the starter checklist templates
GET {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/audits/templates
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Copy a template into your company's checklists (Admin only)
POST {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/audits/templates/commercial-contract
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### List checklists
GET {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/audits/checklists
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Create a checklist (Admin only; severity: Low | Medium | High; at most 40 checks)
POST {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/audits/checklists
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Supplier contract review",
  "description": "Our minimum terms for suppliers",
  "checks": [
    { "title": "Termination notice", "requirement": "Termination for convenience requires at least 90 days' written notice.", "severity": "Medium" },
    { "title": "Liability cap", "requirement": "The supplier's liability is capped at no less than the fees paid in the previous 12 months.", "severity": "High" }
  ]
}

### Replace a checklist's name, description and checks (Admin only)
PUT {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/audits/checklists/{{ChecklistId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Supplier contract review",
  "checks": [
    { "title": "Termination notice", "requirement": "Termination for convenience requires at least 60 days' written notice.", "severity": "Medium" }
  ]
}

### Delete a checklist (Admin only; existing reports are kept)
DELETE {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/audits/checklists/{{ChecklistId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Start an audit of a processed document (runs in the background; poll the run below)
POST {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/audits/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "documentId": "{{DocumentId}}", "checklistId": "{{ChecklistId}}" }

### List audit runs (optionally ?documentId=...)
GET {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/audits/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Get an audit report with findings and evidence
GET {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/audits/runs/{{RunId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}

### Delete an audit report
DELETE {{DocuMind.Api_HostAddress}}/api/audits/runs/{{RunId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
